<title>CANADA: Onex gets 97.88 pct of BC Sugar.</title>
<headline>Onex gets 97.88 pct of BC Sugar.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>BCS Acquisition Inc, a unit of Onex Corp, said on Wednesday it owns 97.88 percent of BC Sugar Refinery Ltd.</p>
<p>BCS said in a statement that it has taken up and paid for the BC Sugar class A and class B common shares deposited under its offer.</p>
<p>Privately-held Balaclava Enterprises Ltd has also transferred to BCS the 5.23 million shares of BC Sugar it holds, BCS said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
